<%- include('../partials/head', { bodyClass: 'login-page' }) %>
<main class="login-shell">
  <section class="login-panel">
    <div class="login-brand">
      <span class="brand-mark">E</span>
      <span><strong>Epay</strong><small>Test Gateway</small></span>
    </div>
    <p class="eyebrow">ACCOUNT LOGIN</p>
    <h1>账户登录</h1>
    <p class="login-subtitle">管理员管理网关，普通用户创建自己的虚拟卡并完成支付。</p>
    <% if (error) { %><div class="alert alert-danger"><%= error %></div><% } %>
    <% if (typeof message !== 'undefined' && message) { %><div class="alert alert-info"><%= message %></div><% } %>
    <form method="post" action="/admin/login" class="stack-form">
      <input type="hidden" name="next" value="<%= next %>">
      <label class="field">
        <span>用户名</span>
        <input type="text" name="username" autocomplete="username" required autofocus placeholder="用户名">
      </label>
      <label class="field">
        <span>密码</span>
        <input type="password" name="password" autocomplete="current-password" required placeholder="输入密码">
      </label>
      <button class="button button-primary button-block" type="submit">登录</button>
    </form>
    <p class="login-hint"><a class="text-link" href="/admin/forgot-password">忘记密码</a></p>
    <p class="login-hint">初始管理员账号由 <code>ADMIN_USERNAME</code> 与 <code>ADMIN_PASSWORD</code> 首次启动时创建。账号权限、分组和邀请规则由管理员配置。</p>
    <% if (registrationEnabled) { %><p class="login-hint">还没有账号？<a class="text-link" href="/register">立即注册</a></p><% } %>
  </section>
  <aside class="login-aside">
    <div class="login-aside-copy">
      <span class="status-dot">SELF-HOSTED</span>
      <h2>一个专为支付联调设计的沙箱。</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>管理员与普通用户分权</li>
        <li>Luhn 校验虚拟卡与自定义 BIN</li>
        <li>余额、3DS 密码、拒付状态控制</li>
        <li>登录选卡或直接绑卡支付</li>
        <li>订单倒计时与签名回调</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </aside>
</main>
</body>
</html>
